{"ticker":"BA","updated":"2026-11-13T22:40:33Z","profile":{"longName":"The Boeing Company","shortName":"Boeing Company (The)","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.boeing.com","fullTimeEmployees":182000,"marketCap":135905165312,"trailingPE":17.69866,"forwardPE":79.293526,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.4318919,"pegRatio":3.73,"targetMeanPrice":233.34615,"targetHighPrice":305.0,"targetLowPrice":157.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.039,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.0945,"operatingMargins":-0.0029199999,"profitMargins":0.08066,"totalRevenue":94913003520,"beta":1.331,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":254.35,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":165.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"The Boeing Company, together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, manufactures, sells, services, and supports commercial jetliners, military aircraft, satellites, missile defense, human space flight and launch systems, and services worldwide. The company operates through three segments: Commercial Airplanes; Defense, Space & Security; and Global Services. The Commercial Airplanes segment develops, produces, and markets commercial jet aircraft for passenger and cargo requirements. The Defense, Space & Security segment engages in the research, development, production, and modification of manned and unmanned military aircraft and weapons systems; strategic defense and intelligence systems, which include strategic missile and defense systems, command, control, communications, computers, intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance, cyber and information solutions, and intelligence systems; and satellite systems, such as government and commercial satellites, and space exploration. The Global Services segment offers products and services, including supply chain and logistics management, engineering, maintenance and modifications, upgrades and conversions, spare parts, pilot and maintenance training systems and services, technical and maintenance documents, and data analytics and digital services to commercial and defense customers. The Boeing Company was incorporated in 1916 an","summary_zh":"波音公司及其子公司在全球設計、開發、製造、銷售、服務和支援商用噴射客機、軍用飛機、衛星、飛彈防禦、載人太空飛行和發射系統以及服務。該公司透過三個部門運作：商用飛機部門；國防、太空與安全；和全球服務。商用飛機部門開發、生產和銷售滿足客運和貨運需求的商用噴射機。國防、太空和安全部門從事有人和無人駕駛軍用飛機和武器系統的研究、開發、生產和改造；戰略防禦和情報系統，包括戰略飛彈和防禦系統、指揮、控制、通訊、電腦、情報、監視和偵察、網路和資訊解決方案以及情報系統；和衛星系統，例如政府和商業衛星以及太空探索。全球服務部門向商業和國防客戶提供產品和服務，包括供應鏈和物流管理、工程、維護和修改、升級和轉換、備件、飛行員和維護培訓系統和服務、技術和維護文件以及數據分析和數位服務。波音公司成立於 1916 年","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":216.25,"h":217.26,"l":214.07,"c":215.75,"v":6896200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":216.86,"h":217.13,"l":213.75,"c":215.02,"v":6330600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":215.59,"h":218.05,"l":213.13,"c":214.63,"v":6019500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":215.23,"h":217.4,"l":213.7,"c":215.66,"v":6414000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":217.73,"h":217.73,"l":213.62,"c":215.65,"v":10513700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":215.17,"h":215.9,"l":211.43,"c":212.09,"v":7467700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":217.12,"h":219.82,"l":214.01,"c":216.34,"v":12760900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":217.56,"h":218.18,"l":214.77,"c":215.1,"v":7354800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":214.87,"h":216.86,"l":211.98,"c":213.53,"v":6649300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":223.36,"h":224.1,"l":219.11,"c":221.26,"v":17281700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":222.37,"h":222.81,"l":215.12,"c":217.08,"v":11290600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":217.1,"h":217.68,"l":212.83,"c":215.83,"v":9289300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":214.01,"h":215.63,"l":213.7,"c":215.2,"v":7178000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":215.45,"h":218.86,"l":215.31,"c":217.43,"v":8281100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":216.75,"h":218.83,"l":215.25,"c":216.3,"v":6634100},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":217.87,"h":221.8,"l":215.9,"c":219.73,"v":7665300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":220.11,"h":223.95,"l":219.2,"c":221.82,"v":7610600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":222.73,"h":226.19,"l":221.47,"c":225.32,"v":6189700},{"t":